                                "sense_id": "46929c39-610b-3e23-b7ed-4fbfd1ef4997",
                                "text": "Within a few days of our reading the report of the vandalish statue-burnings of the Oxford undergrads, we met with the announcement of a wholesale destruction of idols by the natives of Madagascar."
                            },
                            {
